{"title":"1710.02428 A pixel-level model for event discovery in time-domain imaging","markdown":{"headingText":"1710.02428 A pixel-level model for event discovery in time-domain imaging","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：Dun Wang, David W. Hogg, Daniel Foreman-Mackey, Bernhard Schölkopf；2017-10-06（v2）；arXiv:1710.02428\n- **一句话定位**：把因果像素模型（Causal Pixel Model, CPM）从 Kepler 系统误差校正推广为一种无需参考图像、无需点扩散函数（Point Spread Function, PSF）模型的差分成像（difference imaging）方法，用于时域成像中的变源探测。\n- **研究问题**：经典差分成像需先做精确天体配准并估计卷积核以匹配帧间 PSF，在欠采样数据、复杂 PSF 下性能受限且参考图选取无稳健算法；能否用数据驱动的预测模型替代「图像对图像」的减法。\n- **模型与方法**：核心假设是视指向（pointing）、旋转与 PSF 变化由仪器与大气引起，会同时影响视场内所有像素（虽方式不同），而天体物理变源只影响局部像素且与远处像素天体物理上无因果联系。于是每个像素 m 在时刻 t_n 的值由同一 CCD 上距离足够远（≥16 像素、剔除邻近 10 行/列，取最近 400 个）的像素线性预测：I*_{m,n} = Σ_{m'∈M_m} a_{m,m'} I_{m',n}，系数用带 L2 正则（强度 λ_a）的 χ² 最小化求解（模型线性，有解析解）；差分图 D_{m,n} = I_{m,n} − I*_{m,n}。由于预测像素与目标像素因果无关，仪器效应被拟合而真实变率被保留。\n- **主要命题/定理**：无定理，为方法与实验论文。经验结果：(1) 模拟空间数据（TRILEGAL 星表 + 仿射变换模拟指向/旋转，平移 U(0,1) 像素、旋转 U(0,0.5)°，光子噪声 σ=10⁻⁴）：注入的周期变星在差分图中保留，其余像素残差接近光子噪声水平，7×7 孔径可恢复光变曲线；(2) 模拟地面数据（额外令 PSF 半高全宽 fx, fy ~ U(2,3) 像素、取向 φ ~ U(0,π)）仍能消去恒星并探测变源；(3) K2 Campaign 9 微透镜观测（EPIC 200069960，64×50 像素的银心方向密集星场）：常源几乎全部被消去，用归一化绝对偏差均值检测出多个变源并给出 6 条 3×3 孔径光变曲线；(4) 极限测试：以中位 RMS 残差衡量，指向漂移超过约 1 个 PSF FWHM 后差分质量显著退化，旋转主要恶化图像边角，过大的 PSF 变化也会降低性能。\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：属于 Schölkopf 等「用因果不相关变量作预测器以剥离系统效应」思路（前作 CPM, Wang et al. 2016；理论分析 Schölkopf et al. 2016, PNAS）在时域天文中的直接应用：即利用「预测器与目标无因果连接」这一因果假设实现混杂因素去除，是因果思想跨学科（天体物理）应用的代表性案例；面向 LSST、TESS 等大规模时域巡天。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"1710.02428.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","section-title-footnotes":"脚注","section-title-references":"参考文献","section-title-reuse":"二次使用","section-title-copyright":"版权","section-title-citation":"引用格式","appendix-attribution-cite-as":"请按如下格式引用：","appendix-attribution-bibtex":"BibTeX","appendix-view-license":"查看许可协议","title-block-author-single":"作者","title-block-author-plural":"作者","title-block-affiliation-single":"单位","title-block-affiliation-plural":"单位","title-block-published":"发布于","title-block-modified":"修改于","title-block-keywords":"关键词","callout-tip-title":"提示","callout-n